      "officialTitle": "Efficacy and Safety of 2mg/Day of M100907 on Sleep Maintenance Insomnia With a Sub-study of the Effect of M100907 on Stable Type II Diabetes Mellitus: a One Year, Multi-center, Randomized, Double-blind, Placebo-controlled Study",
